1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,326
Most studying disappears because rereading feels familiar, but familiarity is not recall.

2
00:00:05,326 --> 00:00:09,152
Loci Loom turns anything you study into a world you can walk through.

3
00:00:09,152 --> 00:00:12,576
Name a subject, and it creates five strange, visual stops.

4
00:00:12,576 --> 00:00:17,434
Each place binds one idea to a location, an image, and a memory anchor.

5
00:00:17,434 --> 00:00:20,141
Then Loci Loom asks you to retrieve the route.

6
00:00:20,141 --> 00:00:25,032
Every answer strengthens the path, while future sessions focus on what is starting to fade.

7
00:00:25,032 --> 00:00:26,500
Three trails are free.

8
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:32,804
Scholar Pass unlocks unlimited trails, adaptive practice, visual worlds, and voice-guided review.

9
00:00:32,804 --> 00:00:39,739
RevenueCat powers offerings, entitlement checks, purchases, and restoration behind a clean, tested billing boundary.

10
00:00:39,739 --> 00:00:46,945
Next, Nemotron on Nebius can generate and evaluate richer trails, while Alexa turns them into hands-free daily recall.

11
00:00:46,945 --> 00:00:51,913
Loci Loom: a world for every idea, and a path back to every memory.

